        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-01T13:50:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have had a few thoughts in this area, that I need to finish documenting, but:\n\n- I\u0027d like solid color optimizations to be handled consistently across RenderSteps in Graphite, and could be handled as part of the SSBO indexing that\u0027s handled in DrawPass. In this case, RenderSteps need some way of storing a uint32 index, so it\u0027s a little silly to use that to point to a 4byte color in the solid color case. I\u0027m thinking we would have that attribute be either uniform index or narrow color. In the event we need a wide color, the PaintParams analysis switches us to \"color shader\" that has a half4 or float4 uniform that goes in the SSBO and the RenderSteps seamlessly just store the index instead.\n\n- I don\u0027t think we need to store float3 positions. My understanding of when we\u0027ve used them in Ganesh has been if we\u0027ve transformed to device space with a perspective transform, and then need to handle the divide on the local coords instead. Since this bypasses the GPU\u0027s perspective interpolation and clipping, it seems vulnerable to dealing with w \u003c 0 (e.g. drawPaint that just draws the 2D bounds of the device, and then uses local coords). My hope for Graphite is we can keep everything 2D and local (direct subruns withstanding, but we\u0027ve already determined their transforms are trivial), and perspective and 3D only need to be handled when transforming on the GPU to get to the final device position, and then let the GPU handle all clipping and interpolation.\n\n- I know less about whether or not we\u0027d need float texture coords, but it seems like that would be dependent on the size of the atlas pages we use here, right? ushort can go up to 16k so it seems unlikely that we\u0027d get there any time soon.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 33,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 33,
        "endChar": 92
      },
      "revId": "487bd7a8aac1049e34efcf1921a8672f9f1d0531",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "600fea3f_29a8b097",
        "filename": "src/gpu/graphite/render/TextDirectRenderStep.cpp",
