        "id": 5065
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-01T14:09:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As noted, I\u0027d rather use instances in the long run. I believe we should be able to generate glyph quads from them. So this is just temporary regardless.",
